WhenNotTest
├── given pauseType is paused
│   ├── when pauseType is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with IsPaused
│   └── when pauseType is non-zero
│       └── it should revert with IsPaused
├── given pauseType is not paused
│   ├── when pauseType is zero
│   │   └── it should allow function execution
│   └── when pauseType is non-zero
│       └── it should allow function execution
└── given pauseType has never been set
    └── it should allow function execution (default false) 